{# ===========================================================================
   icons.njk — brand marks for profile links.

   Used like this:
     {% from "icons.njk" import icon %}
     {{ icon("GitHub") }}

   It matches on the label you typed in Settings → Site → Profile links.
   Anything it doesn't recognise falls back to plain text, so you can add
   ResearchGate or Bluesky tomorrow and nothing breaks.
   =========================================================================== #}

